' v1.2's service table (`ServiceScene`; `preset classic ai none seed 3
' start 0 party give item_gold`: New Sandez, the companion handed over, gold
' worth 0.75 — nothing — in the pack). Two days for thirst. In single mode
' the leader goes into the pub alone: the companion, left at the entry, has
' no page and drinks nothing (the range is measured from the selected
' character, `serviceLeader`). Placing a thing takes it out of the pack. The
' gold is served for nothing and is gone ("This isn't the Salvation Army!",
' `burn?556`). Out, group mode, and in again at once, the film closed at
' once: the door is in reach, so nobody waits, and the companion is still
' far behind — but `IgnoreRangeFilter` is set, so he has a page and drinks
' from the knife. Then the canteen goes onto the table from the leader's
' page, off it into the companion's page (the page shown takes it), onto
' the table from there, and EXIT hands it to the group, the leader's pack
' first.
press escape             ' Back closes the manual v1.2 opens on a new game's first world map (MapScene.cs:687-691)
mapclick 75,303          ' into New Sandez
wait 60
day
day                      ' both thirsty
group                    ' single mode: the companion stays at the entry
mapclick 309,264         ' the pub, the leader alone
wait 120
esc                      ' the pub's film (`ImageScene`)
wait 5
sceneclick 88,119        ' the bottle onto the table: out of the pack
deal                     ' 4: the leader drinks, the companion has no page
sceneclick 52,156        ' the gold (the pack closed up: fourth slot)
deal                     ' worth nothing: served, and gone
wait 3
snap salvation_army
esc                      ' out; the leader stands at the door
group                    ' group mode, the companion far behind
mapclick 309,264         ' the door is in reach: it opens at once
esc                      ' the film, closed at once
wait 5
sceneclick 124,119       ' the knife onto the table
deal                     ' 11: both drink, however far off he is
sceneclick 88,119        ' the canteen onto the table
pack                     ' the companion's page
sceneclick 176,181       ' the canteen off the table: into his pack
sceneclick 52,119        ' and from his page onto the table again
esc                      ' EXIT: to the group, the leader's pack first
wait 5
save
